4-b763-68ff29913f49"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Biometric Data Doubles and the Technicisation of Personhood in Ghana","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-829350","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"This book takes the contemporary moment of digital health infrastructuring in Ghana as a starting point to examine the genealogies of oral, paper-based and digital forms of knowledge production about health. In view of this multiplicity of forms, the chapters adopt a broad definition of health data that encompasses databases, statistics as well as oral and written records and reports about health. In addition to close historiographic insights into the interactions of indigenous and colonial ways of organising knowledge around health, the chapters explore contemporary ways in which medical professionals are mobilized or potentially demobilized by the standards, methods and calculative devices that accompany the increasing production of health data.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Thiel, Alena","Ntewusu, Samuel Aniegye"],"cuid":["S02-097.78-822877"],"filters":{"added":"2024-09","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Africa"],"country":["Ghana"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University of Ghana"],"keyword":["Africa Studies","Datafication","Ghana","Ghana Studies","Health","Health Information Systems","Health Policy"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum","sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the social life of health data health records and knowledge production in ghana","src":["itu","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"db","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S02-097.78-822877","ids":["itu-80fe1e42-a974-4baa-8290-1407459ff278","ku-6a561105-d2fe-4896-b69d-5859fac36fe2"],"keyword":["Africa Studies","Datafication","Ghana","Ghana Studies","Health","Health Information Systems","Health policy"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities","Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-5-6-13BACB14FDCF6